# Every checkout gets line feeds, whatever the machine is set to.
#
# Without this, a clone on a Windows box with the usual git install writes
# carriage returns into every file, and `prettier --check` then rejects the
# entire tree on a repository nobody has touched. The suite passes, the lint
# passes, and the format gate fails on a fresh clone only. It cost an afternoon
# to work out the first time.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing here is binary, but say so for the ones that would be if they grew.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
